      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-49204",
      ":question/problem": "The following table shows the rate, in pounds per week, at which Mark loses weight after he started a diet.\n\n| $t(week)$ | $1$ | $3$ | $7$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $w(t)(lbs/week)$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n\nUse the trapezoidal rule with the partition\n\n$[1, 3]\u222a[3, 7]$,\n\nto approximate the total weight lost by Mark between weeks $1$ and $7$ of his diet.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
