      ":question/problem": "The following table shows the inflow rate of water, $q(t),$ in $\\text{L/min},$ into a storage tank over a period of $90$ minutes.\n\n| $t\\,(\\text{minutes})$ | $0$ | $20$ | $60$ | $90$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $q(t)\\,(\\text{L/min})$ | $15$ | $25$ | $20$ | $10$ |\n\nUse the trapezoidal rule with the partition\n\n$$\n[0,20]\\cup [20,60]\\cup [60,90],\n$$\n\nto approximate the total volume of water that flowed into the tank in $90$ minutes.\n\nThe total volume is {{field-1}} liters."
